                                "sense_id": "27823bb9-70c7-3246-836d-fe24310f0fca",
                                "text": "Returning with the timber portions of his anchor, to the stone, he would assemble all together […] The ake would be the slightly hollowed part of the stone that fitted closely to the sides […]"
